@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### 메인
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 목록
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### 정상 등록 (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Pydantic 실습","done":false}

### 잘못된 bool (422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"연습","done":"yes"}

### 일부 변경 (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"done":true}

### 없는 ID (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/999
